From 3c38aeeb38421862638d61a6447b4a953f003cff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Tristan=20M=C3=B5ts?= <tristan@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:34:25 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/18] feat(scoring): add pure scoring module, persisted award
 fields and unit tests

- src/lib/scoring: derived round pot, multiplier sanitising, award/strike/adjust
  helpers, fast money totals and configurable win threshold
- Round.awarded_to/awarded_points, Answer.cleanup, FinalRound.awarded and
  Settings.final_round_win_threshold in TS types and Go structs
- vitest (npm test) for scoring math, Go test for mergeGame round-trip
